{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene is anchored by a suitcase located on the left side of the image, which is positioned strictly to the left of a shoe. For every glove present in the composition, it is arranged below the suitcase. A pan is placed to the right of the shoe. Above the pan, there is an apple. A ruler is situated on the bottom side of the layout and is located below the pan. Finally, a pen is placed to the right of the ruler.",
